 "description": "<h2 data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Product Description</h2>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Our vibrating flower massager offers a delightful experience. allowing you to explore the sensations of flowers and intense vibrations. Crafted from high-quality. safe silicone. this G-spot vibrator boasts a soft. smooth texture. ideal for various positions. The delicate and smooth silicone material ensures a secure and pleasurable touch on sensitive areas.</p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><img alt=\"Lotus_Masturbation_Vibrator_1\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/2_66e3b79a-41bd-4588-bbf8-96f749e04f53_480x480.jpg?v=1701654201\"></p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Designed with waterproof capabilities. this vibrator operates with a maximum charging voltage of DC 5V and features a built-in battery with a current below 500mA. To activate. simply press and hold the button for 3 seconds to power on. and do the same to power off. The button controls the vibration patterns when pressed.</p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><img alt=\"Lotus_Masturbation_Vibrator_2\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/6_40c2c38f-79b7-48c0-a510-0a342fef6d75_480x480.jpg?v=1701654225\"></p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Charging the built-in battery is effortless—plug the USB cable into a power outlet with an appropriate adapter or a computer's USB port. During charging. the LED light flashes. indicating the charging process. and remains steadily lit once fully charged. Always use the provided USB cable for charging. ensuring the vibrator is cleaned with a soft cloth if the terminals become dirty.</p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><img alt=\"Lotus_Masturbation_Vibrator_3\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/3_b41b2a71-321a-416e-8f76-d1dc168617cc_480x480.jpg?v=1701654254\"></p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Before the initial use. charge the vibrator for 3 hours at room temperature. and for long-term storage. keep it in a cool. dry place. Remember to unplug the USB cable when not charging to prevent overheating. We prioritize your privacy and discreetly package the product with no visible information. Should you encounter any issues. please don't hesitate to contact us—we're here to assist you!</p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><img alt=\"Lotus_Masturbation_Vibrator_4\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/5_515dc611-0d9f-4a3e-bc46-678aa38de426_480x480.jpg?v=1701654270\"></p>\n",
